<title>USA: Intek names Montellaro CFO.</title>
<headline>Intek names Montellaro CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MOORESTOWN, N.J. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intek Diversified Corp said Tuesday that it has named Lee Montellaro chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a press release, Intek, a wireless communications services provider, said that Montellaro was previously an independent corporate finance consultant.</p>
<p>Before that, he was chief executive of Luxcel Group Inc, a paging carrier and distributor of cellular products.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman said Montellaro fills a newly created position.</p>
</text>
